                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts22" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts35">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>[Or maybe I did,] but I, cause the ones where you like, you can dip, [right? So] you get your [food out], you dip it in and then you [eat it], I don't- because like a lot of times with those things I'm always a little bit nervous, [cause of like] cross-contamination or someone like putting one spoon from one thing into the [other, so I always], I don't know=</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
